       https://github.com/Nesbesss/khatib-chess

   The URL must be visible to the people using your work, not buried in source
   comments or a licence file alone. Specifically:

     a) SOFTWARE AND ENGINES — show it in the program: a UCI "id author" or
        startup line, an about box, a --version output, or the README of a
        distributed build.

     b) BOTS AND ONLINE SERVICES — show it where users of that bot or service
        can read it: the account profile or bio, an about page, or a message
        the bot sends. A Lichess or chess-site bot must carry it in its
        profile description.

     c) WEBSITES, APPS AND PRODUCTS — show it in the interface or on a
        credits/about page reachable from the interface.

     d) PAPERS, VIDEOS, POSTS AND PRESENTATIONS — show it in the text,
        description, or on screen.

   Suggested wording:

       Powered by Khatib by Nassim Khatib
       https://github.com/Nesbesss/khatib-chess

   Removing, obscuring, or relocating this attribution out of view terminates
   the rights granted by this licence (see section 7).

